OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with spells of rain
OL,6,Ftoday, heavy at times mainly over the
OL,7,Fhills. Some drier and brighter
OL,8,Finterludes in the south are possible.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly in the north, milder in
OL,10,Fthe south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWet conditions continuing
OL,13,Finto the evening and overnight, with
OL,14,Fheavier downpours over the hills. Some
OL,15,Fdrier interludes at times. Winds
OL,16,Fgradually strengthening in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
