OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FPatchy cloud and rain to
OL,6,Fbegin, clearing slowly southwards
OL,7,Fthrough the day. Drier albeit
OL,8,Fremaining cloudy in Cumbria. Breezy
OL,9,Fand feeling chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBrighter
OL,12,Fand colder weather into Friday with
OL,13,Fplenty of sunshine and widespread
OL,14,Ffrosts forming overnight. Becoming
OL,15,Fcloudier into Saturday, with a chance
OL,16,Fof rain into Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
